          "body": "Compare the three e-bike batteries we shortlisted. Range, weight, cycle life, price per Wh.",
          "createdAt": "2026-10-19T12:15:40.000Z"
        },
        {
          "id": "m-bike-2",
          "role": "identity",
          "body": "| Pack | Capacity | Weight | Cycle life | £ per Wh |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Volta 500 | 500 Wh | 2.9 kg | 900 | £0.92 |\n| Ridgeline 625 | 625 Wh | 3.4 kg | 1,000 | £0.88 |\n| Coastal 720 | 720 Wh | 4.1 kg | 700 | £0.81 |\n\nRidgeline is the best balance: 25% more range than Volta for half a kilo, and the longest cycle life. Coastal is cheapest per Wh but loses capacity fastest. The full notes are in the Vault under reference.",
          "createdAt": "2026-10-19T12:33:09.000Z"
        }
      ],
