          "body": "Three changes worth making this week:\n\n1. Sea Salt sold out twice. Raise it from £18 to £20; it is still under the two nearest competitors.\n2. The gift set converts at 1.1%. Bundle a free matchbox instead of cutting the price.\n3. Shipping over £40 is free, and 62% of orders land between £34 and £39. A £35 threshold would lift basket size.\n\nI've put the reasoning in the Vault. Nothing changes on the shop until you say so.",
